{
  "title": { "zh": "多一个条件也无妨" },
  "tray": "proof",
  "intro": [{ "t": { "zh": "这一关没有已知。" } }],
  "after": {
    "zh": "在没有框的<wiki-ref to=\"hilbert\"></wiki-ref>里，K 是一条不用证的<wiki-ref to=\"axiom\"></wiki-ref>。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "k_1",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "假设什么，就得到什么" },
      "tests": [{ "goal": "A → A" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain" }, { "A": "Sat" }],
      "hint": [{ "zh": "框里看得见哪些话？" }],
      "solution": ["f = impI[A=A](body: f.body)", "goal <- f"]
    },
    {
      "id": "k_2",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "多一个条件也无妨" },
      "tests": [{ "goal": "A → (B → A)" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain", "B": "Wind" }, { "A": "Coffee", "B": "Late" }],
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "目标里有几个 →？" },
        { "zh": "里面的框看得见外面框的假设。" }
      ],
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "已经成立的事，加上什么条件都还成立：不管刮不刮风，下雨就是下雨。这句话叫 <part-ref to=\"lemma:axK\"></part-ref>。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["f = impI[A=A](body: g) {", "  body {", "    g = impI[A=B](body: f.body)", "  }", "}", "goal <- f"]
    }
  ]
}
